    "type": "game",
    "name": "A Killer Chat! Christmas",
    "steam_appid": 3495110,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: this is a standalone game. You do not need to download Killer Chat!\u00a0to play, but we do recommend playing through\u00a0Killer Chat!  first (it's free!)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME BACK TO HELL, LOSERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a year has passed since asking too many murder-related questions online (for your <i>book</i>) got you invited to a serial killer chatroom. Of course, you did what<i> any</i> <span class=\"bb_strike\">in</span>sane person would do and<span class=\"bb_strike\"> called the police</span> pretended to be a serial killer. For, uh\u2026\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">hot singles in your server</span>\u00a0research purposes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somehow, you got your <span class=\"bb_strike\">bad</span> happy ending. You\u2019re now a bestselling writer, desperately in love, and have come to think of the server as family - it's like a dream come true. Sure, most of them still think you are a serial killer, your boss needs you to write another hit ASAP and your one true love is <span class=\"bb_strike\">definitely</span> <i>technically </i>a murderer, but look on the bright side - it\u2019s Christmas!\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/559309784fc03ee8a7c83cd06ba731fe.avif?t=1751964923\" data-has-big width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/4afc5f89b6e139b8b9040cbe3a10304a.avif?t=1751964923\" data-has-big width=800 height=634 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this festive addition to the dark satire romance chatsim Killer Chat!\u00a0series, journey through the server\u2019s past, present &amp; future to learn more about our serials and find the true meaning of Christmas. What's the worst that could happen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a (fully customisable!) character as you\u2026\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DATE SERIAL KILLERS!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whisper sweet nothings to your murderous beau and\u00a0learn more about their <span class=\"bb_strike\">insecurities</span> lives!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAT IN THE SLAUGHTERHOUSE :)\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The server's hosting a secret Santa blitz! Unlock <strong>16 unique gift options</strong> to impress (or distress) your loved one, and help the other serials decide what to get each other!\u00a0And no Christmas would be complete without\u00a0a delicious server meal on the 26th of December. It's true: Vince has made Christmas dinners a yearly thing now.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/727708a1fcb0c47e755d5efa258f1c15.avif?t=1751964923\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GET INSPIRATION FOR YOUR SHORT STORY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spending time in the server helped write a hit before, maybe it\u2019ll help you again? Ugh. Why is writing so\u00a0<i>hard?</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/559309784fc03ee8a7c83cd06ba731fe.avif?t=1751964923\" data-has-big width=800 height=103 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisable MC -</strong> now with festive wear!\u00a0(Name, username, personality, gender, face, body, clothing, accessories, what kind of pseudo serial killer you are...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/183df89a2d6b3ac070a93cf30fb3a714.avif?t=1751964923\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write your own status, biography, and messages in chat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/a23379b92903f3a82a44b3f6d672eafd.avif?t=1751964923\" data-has-big width=800 height=520 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four <span class=\"bb_strike\">serial killers</span> love interests <strong>across all genders </strong>(male, female, non-binary)...\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playtime of approx. <strong>2-3 hours </strong>per route,<strong>\u00a08-10 hours </strong>for all routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-rich, choice-based branching towards<strong>\u00a06 unique endings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call the server's serial killers, earn the gang's\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">dis</span>approval, and more!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement system with <strong>30+\u00a0unique achievements</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An assortment of new art, including two illustrated CG's!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom-made OST and sound effects.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTENT WARNINGS\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death, murder, swearing, references to abuse, and serial killers... but you knew that.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET YOUR LOVE INTERESTS</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/f7ab8e78510d23ec49ff5721aa9e15b2.avif?t=1751964923\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/595c625aeab6cb2b23c6272b29aa14de.avif?t=1751964923\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/7e5f3d4ed542fd93e2b90450414908a6.avif?t=1751964923\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495110/extras/dffb2382dd0dd2e6812358b1e09d0eaf.avif?t=1751964923\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND THE REST\u00a0OF THE GANG!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend some more time getting to know\u00a0the server\u2019s other <span class=\"bb_strike\">murderers</span> loved-up couples. Help French arsonist Felicie and her unlucky surfer beau Luca decide what to get each other for Secret Santa,\u00a0and see\u00a0a softer side of\u00a0Sunset Slasher Vince now his relationship with\u00a0Ai Hua has gone public!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SO HAVE A MERRY F'ING CHRISTMAS, LOSERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And may all your dreams come true...</p>",
